      ],
      "source": "https://www.nohopapa.com/wwai",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1936 Waialua Sugar Company building now houses the Waialua Heritage Center, preserving local stories and culture.",
